---
title: Vercel AI Gateway
id: vercel-gateway-adapter
description: "Use one API key to reach many providers through Vercel AI Gateway. Route, fall back, and generate chat, embeddings, and images with @tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway."
keywords:
  - tanstack ai
  - vercel
  - ai gateway
  - adapter
  - routing
  - fallback
  - embeddings
  - image generation
  - evaluate
  - jev
---
NIFT_TANSTACK_DOCUMENT_V1
{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"You want one API key and one URL, and you still want to pick the provider per request. Vercel AI Gateway sits in front of many model providers. This package talks to that public OpenAI-compatible API."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Install "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway"},{"type":"text","value":". Then call "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"vercelGatewayText"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"vercelGatewayEmbedding"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"vercelGatewayImage"},{"type":"text","value":", or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"vercelGatewayDecider"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"installation","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Installation"}]},{"type":"component","name":"tabs","attributes":{"variant":"package-manager","mode":"install"},"children":[],"properties":{"data-package-manager-meta":"{\"packagesByFramework\":{\"react\":[[\"@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\"]],\"vue\":[[\"@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\"]],\"solid\":[[\"@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\"]],\"svelte\":[[\"@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\"]],\"preact\":[[\"@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\"]],\"angular\":[[\"@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\"]],\"vanilla\":[[\"@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\"]],\"octane\":[[\"@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\"]]},\"mode\":\"install\"}"}},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"auth","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Auth"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Set "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY"},{"type":"text","value":". If that key is not set, the adapter uses "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"VERCEL_OIDC_TOKEN"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"code","value":"export AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=\"...\"","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"You can also pass the key to a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"create*"},{"type":"text","value":" factory:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { createVercelGatewayText } from \"@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\"\n\nconst adapter = createVercelGatewayText(\n  \"anthropic/claude-opus-5\",\n  process.env.AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY!,\n)","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"chat","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Chat"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The default adapter uses the OpenAI Responses API at "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"https://ai-gateway.vercel.sh/v1"},{"type":"text","value":". Model ids use the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"creator/model"},{"type":"text","value":" form."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Server."}]},{"type":"text","value":" An endpoint that streams the reply over SSE:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { chat, toServerSentEventsResponse } from \"@tanstack/ai\"\nimport { vercelGatewayText } from \"@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\"\n\nexport async function POST(request: Request) {\n  const { messages } = await request.json()\n\n  const stream = chat({\n    adapter: vercelGatewayText(\"anthropic/claude-opus-5\"),\n    messages,\n  })\n\n  return toServerSentEventsResponse(stream)\n}","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Client."}]},{"type":"text","value":" The same "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useChat"},{"type":"text","value":" hook as every other provider:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { useState } from \"react\"\nimport { fetchServerSentEvents, useChat } from \"@tanstack/ai-react\"\n\nexport function Chat() {\n  const [input, setInput] = useState(\"\")\n\n  const { messages, sendMessage, isLoading } = useChat({\n    connection: fetchServerSentEvents(\"/api/chat\"),\n  })\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      {messages.map((message) => (\n        <div key={message.id}>\n          <strong>{message.role}</strong>\n          {message.parts.map((part, index) =>\n            part.type === \"text\" ? <p key={index}>{part.content}</p> : null,\n          )}\n        </div>\n      ))}\n\n      <form\n        onSubmit={(event) => {\n          event.preventDefault()\n          if (!input.trim() || isLoading) return\n          sendMessage(input)\n          setInput(\"\")\n        }}\n      >\n        <input value={input} onChange={(event) => setInput(event.target.value)} />\n        <button type=\"submit\" disabled={isLoading}>\n          Send\n        </button>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n  )\n}","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"chat-completions","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Chat Completions"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Pass "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"{ api: \"chat\" }"},{"type":"text","value":" when the model must talk to Chat Completions. The default is Responses."}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { chat } from \"@tanstack/ai\"\nimport { vercelGatewayText } from \"@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\"\n\nconst stream = chat({\n  adapter: vercelGatewayText(\"openai/gpt-5.5\", { api: \"chat\" }),\n  messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: \"Hello\" }],\n})","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"api: \"responses\""},{"type":"text","value":" is the same as the default. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"api: \"chat-completions\""},{"type":"text","value":" is the same as "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"api: \"chat\""},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"gateway-routing","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Gateway routing"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Put Gateway routing on "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"modelOptions.gateway"},{"type":"text","value":". The adapter sends those fields as "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"providerOptions.gateway"},{"type":"text","value":". Do not put "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"gateway"},{"type":"text","value":" at the top level of the request body."}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { chat } from \"@tanstack/ai\"\nimport { vercelGatewayText } from \"@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\"\n\nconst stream = chat({\n  adapter: vercelGatewayText(\"anthropic/claude-opus-5\"),\n  messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: \"Hello\" }],\n  modelOptions: {\n    gateway: {\n      order: [\"anthropic\", \"openai\"],\n      only: [\"anthropic\"],\n      sort: \"cost\",\n      models: [\"anthropic/claude-opus-5\", \"openai/gpt-5.5\"],\n      caching: \"auto\",\n      disallowPromptTraining: true,\n    },\n  },\n})","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"order"},{"type":"text","value":" is the provider try list. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"only"},{"type":"text","value":" limits which providers can run. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"sort"},{"type":"text","value":" picks cost, time to first token, or tokens per second. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"models"},{"type":"text","value":" is the fallback model list."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"order"},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"only"},{"type":"text","value":" accept catalog provider ids such as "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"anthropic\""},{"type":"text","value":". "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"models"},{"type":"text","value":" accepts catalog chat model ids. Each chat model also has its own "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"modelOptions"},{"type":"text","value":" keys and input types from the catalog. A text-only model does not accept image parts. A model without "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"temperature"},{"type":"text","value":" in the catalog does not accept "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"temperature"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"embeddings","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Embeddings"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { embed } from \"@tanstack/ai\"\nimport { vercelGatewayEmbedding } from \"@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\"\n\nconst result = await embed({\n  adapter: vercelGatewayEmbedding(\"openai/text-embedding-3-small\"),\n  input: \"a red guitar\",\n})\n\nconsole.log(result.embeddings[0]?.vector)","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"image","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Image"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Image generation is text-to-image only. The adapter calls "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"POST /v1/images/generations"},{"type":"text","value":". Image edits are not in this package yet."}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { generateImage } from \"@tanstack/ai\"\nimport { vercelGatewayImage } from \"@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\"\n\nconst result = await generateImage({\n  adapter: vercelGatewayImage(\"openai/gpt-image-1\"),\n  prompt: \"a red guitar\",\n})","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"summarize","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Summarize"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { summarize } from \"@tanstack/ai\"\nimport { vercelGatewaySummarize } from \"@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\"\n\nconst result = await summarize({\n  adapter: vercelGatewaySummarize(\"anthropic/claude-opus-5\"),\n  text: \"The Fender Stratocaster is a versatile electric guitar.\",\n  stream: false,\n})","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"evaluate","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Evaluate"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Use "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"vercelGatewayDecider"},{"type":"text","value":" with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"decide()"},{"type":"text","value":". The request goes to\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"POST https://ai-gateway.vercel.sh/v4/ai/evaluation-model"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { decide, choice, score, boolean } from \"@tanstack/ai\"\nimport { vercelGatewayDecider } from \"@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\"\n\nconst ticket = {\n  subject: \"Charged twice for the same invoice\",\n  body: \"Please refund the extra payment.\",\n}\n\nconst result = await decide({\n  adapter: vercelGatewayDecider(\"typesafe-ai/jev\"),\n  state: ticket,\n  questions: {\n    queue: choice({\n      instructions: \"Which team should handle this ticket?\",\n      options: {\n        billing: \"Payments, invoices, refunds\",\n        tech: \"Bugs, outages, integrations\",\n        sales: \"Pricing, upgrades, new accounts\",\n      },\n    }),\n    urgency: score({\n      instructions: \"How urgent is this ticket?\",\n      levels: [\"low\", \"medium\", \"high\"],\n    }),\n    refund: boolean({\n      instructions: \"Is the customer asking for a refund?\",\n    }),\n  },\n})\n\nconsole.log(result.queue.value)\nconsole.log(result.queue.probability)\nconsole.log(result.queue.confidence)\nconsole.log(result.meta.usage)","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"vercelGatewayDecider"},{"type":"text","value":" reads "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY"},{"type":"text","value":", then "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"VERCEL_OIDC_TOKEN"},{"type":"text","value":".\nPass a key yourself with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createVercelGatewayDecider(\"typesafe-ai/jev\", \"vck_...\")"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Put Gateway routing on "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"modelOptions.gateway"},{"type":"text","value":", the same as chat."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"See the "},{"type":"link","href":"../evaluate/evaluate","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Evaluate guide"}]},{"type":"text","value":" for question helpers, the result\nshape, abort, and middleware."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"what-this-package-does-not-do","children":[{"type":"text","value":"What this package does not do"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This package does not generate video. It does not do speech, transcription, or rerank. Use a dedicated adapter for those activities."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The catalog is a closed list from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"GET /v1/models"},{"type":"text","value":". Daily CI updates that list."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"installation","text":"Installation","level":2},{"id":"auth","text":"Auth","level":2},{"id":"chat","text":"Chat","level":2},{"id":"chat-completions","text":"Chat Completions","level":2},{"id":"gateway-routing","text":"Gateway routing","level":2},{"id":"embeddings","text":"Embeddings","level":2},{"id":"image","text":"Image","level":2},{"id":"summarize","text":"Summarize","level":2},{"id":"evaluate","text":"Evaluate","level":2},{"id":"what-this-package-does-not-do","text":"What this package does not do","level":2}]},"frameworks":["react","vue","solid","svelte","preact","angular","vanilla","octane"],"downloadMarkdown":"\nYou want one API key and one URL, and you still want to pick the provider per request. Vercel AI Gateway sits in front of many model providers. This package talks to that public OpenAI-compatible API.\n\nInstall `@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway`. Then call `vercelGatewayText`, `vercelGatewayEmbedding`, `vercelGatewayImage`, or `vercelGatewayDecider`.\n\n## Installation\n\n<!-- ::start:tabs variant=\"package-manager\" mode=\"install\" -->\n\nreact: @tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\nvue: @tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\nsolid: @tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\nsvelte: @tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\npreact: @tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\nangular: @tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\nvanilla: @tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\noctane: @tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\n\n<!-- ::end:tabs -->\n\n## Auth\n\nSet `AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY`. If that key is not set, the adapter uses `VERCEL_OIDC_TOKEN`.\n\n```bash\nexport AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=\"...\"\n```\n\nYou can also pass the key to a `create*` factory:\n\n```typescript\nimport { createVercelGatewayText } from \"@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\"\n\nconst adapter = createVercelGatewayText(\n  \"anthropic/claude-opus-5\",\n  process.env.AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY!,\n)\n```\n\n## Chat\n\nThe default adapter uses the OpenAI Responses API at `https://ai-gateway.vercel.sh/v1`. Model ids use the `creator/model` form.\n\n**Server.** An endpoint that streams the reply over SSE:\n\n```typescript\nimport { chat, toServerSentEventsResponse } from \"@tanstack/ai\"\nimport { vercelGatewayText } from \"@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\"\n\nexport async function POST(request: Request) {\n  const { messages } = await request.json()\n\n  const stream = chat({\n    adapter: vercelGatewayText(\"anthropic/claude-opus-5\"),\n    messages,\n  })\n\n  return toServerSentEventsResponse(stream)\n}\n```\n\n**Client.** The same `useChat` hook as every other provider:\n\n```tsx\nimport { useState } from \"react\"\nimport { fetchServerSentEvents, useChat } from \"@tanstack/ai-react\"\n\nexport function Chat() {\n  const [input, setInput] = useState(\"\")\n\n  const { messages, sendMessage, isLoading } = useChat({\n    connection: fetchServerSentEvents(\"/api/chat\"),\n  })\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      {messages.map((message) => (\n        <div key={message.id}>\n          <strong>{message.role}</strong>\n          {message.parts.map((part, index) =>\n            part.type === \"text\" ? <p key={index}>{part.content}</p> : null,\n          )}\n        </div>\n      ))}\n\n      <form\n        onSubmit={(event) => {\n          event.preventDefault()\n          if (!input.trim() || isLoading) return\n          sendMessage(input)\n          setInput(\"\")\n        }}\n      >\n        <input value={input} onChange={(event) => setInput(event.target.value)} />\n        <button type=\"submit\" disabled={isLoading}>\n          Send\n        </button>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Chat Completions\n\nPass `{ api: \"chat\" }` when the model must talk to Chat Completions. The default is Responses.\n\n```typescript\nimport { chat } from \"@tanstack/ai\"\nimport { vercelGatewayText } from \"@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\"\n\nconst stream = chat({\n  adapter: vercelGatewayText(\"openai/gpt-5.5\", { api: \"chat\" }),\n  messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: \"Hello\" }],\n})\n```\n\n`api: \"responses\"` is the same as the default. `api: \"chat-completions\"` is the same as `api: \"chat\"`.\n\n## Gateway routing\n\nPut Gateway routing on `modelOptions.gateway`. The adapter sends those fields as `providerOptions.gateway`. Do not put `gateway` at the top level of the request body.\n\n```typescript\nimport { chat } from \"@tanstack/ai\"\nimport { vercelGatewayText } from \"@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\"\n\nconst stream = chat({\n  adapter: vercelGatewayText(\"anthropic/claude-opus-5\"),\n  messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: \"Hello\" }],\n  modelOptions: {\n    gateway: {\n      order: [\"anthropic\", \"openai\"],\n      only: [\"anthropic\"],\n      sort: \"cost\",\n      models: [\"anthropic/claude-opus-5\", \"openai/gpt-5.5\"],\n      caching: \"auto\",\n      disallowPromptTraining: true,\n    },\n  },\n})\n```\n\n`order` is the provider try list. `only` limits which providers can run. `sort` picks cost, time to first token, or tokens per second. `models` is the fallback model list.\n\n`order` and `only` accept catalog provider ids such as `\"anthropic\"`. `models` accepts catalog chat model ids. Each chat model also has its own `modelOptions` keys and input types from the catalog. A text-only model does not accept image parts. A model without `temperature` in the catalog does not accept `temperature`.\n\n## Embeddings\n\n```typescript\nimport { embed } from \"@tanstack/ai\"\nimport { vercelGatewayEmbedding } from \"@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\"\n\nconst result = await embed({\n  adapter: vercelGatewayEmbedding(\"openai/text-embedding-3-small\"),\n  input: \"a red guitar\",\n})\n\nconsole.log(result.embeddings[0]?.vector)\n```\n\n## Image\n\nImage generation is text-to-image only. The adapter calls `POST /v1/images/generations`. Image edits are not in this package yet.\n\n```typescript\nimport { generateImage } from \"@tanstack/ai\"\nimport { vercelGatewayImage } from \"@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\"\n\nconst result = await generateImage({\n  adapter: vercelGatewayImage(\"openai/gpt-image-1\"),\n  prompt: \"a red guitar\",\n})\n```\n\n## Summarize\n\n```typescript\nimport { summarize } from \"@tanstack/ai\"\nimport { vercelGatewaySummarize } from \"@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\"\n\nconst result = await summarize({\n  adapter: vercelGatewaySummarize(\"anthropic/claude-opus-5\"),\n  text: \"The Fender Stratocaster is a versatile electric guitar.\",\n  stream: false,\n})\n```\n\n## Evaluate\n\nUse `vercelGatewayDecider` with `decide()`. The request goes to\n`POST https://ai-gateway.vercel.sh/v4/ai/evaluation-model`.\n\n```typescript\nimport { decide, choice, score, boolean } from \"@tanstack/ai\"\nimport { vercelGatewayDecider } from \"@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\"\n\nconst ticket = {\n  subject: \"Charged twice for the same invoice\",\n  body: \"Please refund the extra payment.\",\n}\n\nconst result = await decide({\n  adapter: vercelGatewayDecider(\"typesafe-ai/jev\"),\n  state: ticket,\n  questions: {\n    queue: choice({\n      instructions: \"Which team should handle this ticket?\",\n      options: {\n        billing: \"Payments, invoices, refunds\",\n        tech: \"Bugs, outages, integrations\",\n        sales: \"Pricing, upgrades, new accounts\",\n      },\n    }),\n    urgency: score({\n      instructions: \"How urgent is this ticket?\",\n      levels: [\"low\", \"medium\", \"high\"],\n    }),\n    refund: boolean({\n      instructions: \"Is the customer asking for a refund?\",\n    }),\n  },\n})\n\nconsole.log(result.queue.value)\nconsole.log(result.queue.probability)\nconsole.log(result.queue.confidence)\nconsole.log(result.meta.usage)\n```\n\n`vercelGatewayDecider` reads `AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY`, then `VERCEL_OIDC_TOKEN`.\nPass a key yourself with `createVercelGatewayDecider(\"typesafe-ai/jev\", \"vck_...\")`.\n\nPut Gateway routing on `modelOptions.gateway`, the same as chat.\n\nSee the [Evaluate guide](../evaluate/evaluate) for question helpers, the result\nshape, abort, and middleware.\n\n## What this package does not do\n\nThis package does not generate video. It does not do speech, transcription, or rerank. Use a dedicated adapter for those activities.\n\nThe catalog is a closed list from `GET /v1/models`. Daily CI updates that list.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Vercel AI Gateway\nid: vercel-gateway-adapter\ndescription: \"Use one API key to reach many providers through Vercel AI Gateway. Route, fall back, and generate chat, embeddings, and images with @tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway.\"\nkeywords:\n  - tanstack ai\n  - vercel\n  - ai gateway\n  - adapter\n  - routing\n  - fallback\n  - embeddings\n  - image generation\n  - evaluate\n  - jev\n---\n\nYou want one API key and one URL, and you still want to pick the provider per request. Vercel AI Gateway sits in front of many model providers. This package talks to that public OpenAI-compatible API.\n\nInstall `@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway`. Then call `vercelGatewayText`, `vercelGatewayEmbedding`, `vercelGatewayImage`, or `vercelGatewayDecider`.\n\n## Installation\n\n<!-- ::start:tabs variant=\"package-manager\" mode=\"install\" -->\n\nreact: @tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\nvue: @tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\nsolid: @tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\nsvelte: @tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\npreact: @tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\nangular: @tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\nvanilla: @tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\noctane: @tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\n\n<!-- ::end:tabs -->\n\n## Auth\n\nSet `AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY`. If that key is not set, the adapter uses `VERCEL_OIDC_TOKEN`.\n\n```bash\nexport AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=\"...\"\n```\n\nYou can also pass the key to a `create*` factory:\n\n```typescript\nimport { createVercelGatewayText } from \"@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\"\n\nconst adapter = createVercelGatewayText(\n  \"anthropic/claude-opus-5\",\n  process.env.AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY!,\n)\n```\n\n## Chat\n\nThe default adapter uses the OpenAI Responses API at `https://ai-gateway.vercel.sh/v1`. Model ids use the `creator/model` form.\n\n**Server.** An endpoint that streams the reply over SSE:\n\n```typescript\nimport { chat, toServerSentEventsResponse } from \"@tanstack/ai\"\nimport { vercelGatewayText } from \"@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\"\n\nexport async function POST(request: Request) {\n  const { messages } = await request.json()\n\n  const stream = chat({\n    adapter: vercelGatewayText(\"anthropic/claude-opus-5\"),\n    messages,\n  })\n\n  return toServerSentEventsResponse(stream)\n}\n```\n\n**Client.** The same `useChat` hook as every other provider:\n\n```tsx\nimport { useState } from \"react\"\nimport { fetchServerSentEvents, useChat } from \"@tanstack/ai-react\"\n\nexport function Chat() {\n  const [input, setInput] = useState(\"\")\n\n  const { messages, sendMessage, isLoading } = useChat({\n    connection: fetchServerSentEvents(\"/api/chat\"),\n  })\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      {messages.map((message) => (\n        <div key={message.id}>\n          <strong>{message.role}</strong>\n          {message.parts.map((part, index) =>\n            part.type === \"text\" ? <p key={index}>{part.content}</p> : null,\n          )}\n        </div>\n      ))}\n\n      <form\n        onSubmit={(event) => {\n          event.preventDefault()\n          if (!input.trim() || isLoading) return\n          sendMessage(input)\n          setInput(\"\")\n        }}\n      >\n        <input value={input} onChange={(event) => setInput(event.target.value)} />\n        <button type=\"submit\" disabled={isLoading}>\n          Send\n        </button>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Chat Completions\n\nPass `{ api: \"chat\" }` when the model must talk to Chat Completions. The default is Responses.\n\n```typescript\nimport { chat } from \"@tanstack/ai\"\nimport { vercelGatewayText } from \"@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\"\n\nconst stream = chat({\n  adapter: vercelGatewayText(\"openai/gpt-5.5\", { api: \"chat\" }),\n  messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: \"Hello\" }],\n})\n```\n\n`api: \"responses\"` is the same as the default. `api: \"chat-completions\"` is the same as `api: \"chat\"`.\n\n## Gateway routing\n\nPut Gateway routing on `modelOptions.gateway`. The adapter sends those fields as `providerOptions.gateway`. Do not put `gateway` at the top level of the request body.\n\n```typescript\nimport { chat } from \"@tanstack/ai\"\nimport { vercelGatewayText } from \"@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\"\n\nconst stream = chat({\n  adapter: vercelGatewayText(\"anthropic/claude-opus-5\"),\n  messages: [{ role: \"user\", content: \"Hello\" }],\n  modelOptions: {\n    gateway: {\n      order: [\"anthropic\", \"openai\"],\n      only: [\"anthropic\"],\n      sort: \"cost\",\n      models: [\"anthropic/claude-opus-5\", \"openai/gpt-5.5\"],\n      caching: \"auto\",\n      disallowPromptTraining: true,\n    },\n  },\n})\n```\n\n`order` is the provider try list. `only` limits which providers can run. `sort` picks cost, time to first token, or tokens per second. `models` is the fallback model list.\n\n`order` and `only` accept catalog provider ids such as `\"anthropic\"`. `models` accepts catalog chat model ids. Each chat model also has its own `modelOptions` keys and input types from the catalog. A text-only model does not accept image parts. A model without `temperature` in the catalog does not accept `temperature`.\n\n## Embeddings\n\n```typescript\nimport { embed } from \"@tanstack/ai\"\nimport { vercelGatewayEmbedding } from \"@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\"\n\nconst result = await embed({\n  adapter: vercelGatewayEmbedding(\"openai/text-embedding-3-small\"),\n  input: \"a red guitar\",\n})\n\nconsole.log(result.embeddings[0]?.vector)\n```\n\n## Image\n\nImage generation is text-to-image only. The adapter calls `POST /v1/images/generations`. Image edits are not in this package yet.\n\n```typescript\nimport { generateImage } from \"@tanstack/ai\"\nimport { vercelGatewayImage } from \"@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\"\n\nconst result = await generateImage({\n  adapter: vercelGatewayImage(\"openai/gpt-image-1\"),\n  prompt: \"a red guitar\",\n})\n```\n\n## Summarize\n\n```typescript\nimport { summarize } from \"@tanstack/ai\"\nimport { vercelGatewaySummarize } from \"@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\"\n\nconst result = await summarize({\n  adapter: vercelGatewaySummarize(\"anthropic/claude-opus-5\"),\n  text: \"The Fender Stratocaster is a versatile electric guitar.\",\n  stream: false,\n})\n```\n\n## Evaluate\n\nUse `vercelGatewayDecider` with `decide()`. The request goes to\n`POST https://ai-gateway.vercel.sh/v4/ai/evaluation-model`.\n\n```typescript\nimport { decide, choice, score, boolean } from \"@tanstack/ai\"\nimport { vercelGatewayDecider } from \"@tanstack/ai-vercel-gateway\"\n\nconst ticket = {\n  subject: \"Charged twice for the same invoice\",\n  body: \"Please refund the extra payment.\",\n}\n\nconst result = await decide({\n  adapter: vercelGatewayDecider(\"typesafe-ai/jev\"),\n  state: ticket,\n  questions: {\n    queue: choice({\n      instructions: \"Which team should handle this ticket?\",\n      options: {\n        billing: \"Payments, invoices, refunds\",\n        tech: \"Bugs, outages, integrations\",\n        sales: \"Pricing, upgrades, new accounts\",\n      },\n    }),\n    urgency: score({\n      instructions: \"How urgent is this ticket?\",\n      levels: [\"low\", \"medium\", \"high\"],\n    }),\n    refund: boolean({\n      instructions: \"Is the customer asking for a refund?\",\n    }),\n  },\n})\n\nconsole.log(result.queue.value)\nconsole.log(result.queue.probability)\nconsole.log(result.queue.confidence)\nconsole.log(result.meta.usage)\n```\n\n`vercelGatewayDecider` reads `AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY`, then `VERCEL_OIDC_TOKEN`.\nPass a key yourself with `createVercelGatewayDecider(\"typesafe-ai/jev\", \"vck_...\")`.\n\nPut Gateway routing on `modelOptions.gateway`, the same as chat.\n\nSee the [Evaluate guide](../evaluate/evaluate) for question helpers, the result\nshape, abort, and middleware.\n\n## What this package does not do\n\nThis package does not generate video. It does not do speech, transcription, or rerank. Use a dedicated adapter for those activities.\n\nThe catalog is a closed list from `GET /v1/models`. Daily CI updates that list.\n"}
